# BUy A nEW Drum in 2014

Buy a new drum in 2014 and get a free drumming course in 2015. This November we have some beautiful new West African shells arriving, shells will be skinned up for December, just in time for Christmas! All December drum purchases will receive a FREE African drumming course in the first term of 2015 which consists of a 5 week course with weekly [Youtube video clips](https://www.youtube.com/user/rhythmcultureable) so you can enjoy playing at home!
